# Conformance probe pack for a `hex` field of the largest length, 2040 bits
# (spec 0.22, Fields longer than 64 bits). Public. No kinds. Most significant
# bit first.
#
#   bytes 0..254  label  510 hex digits
format     conformance-long-hex-max
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
word_bytes 1
bit_order  msb
field   probe.label  0:0:2040  hex
